Strategy that's more suited to an investing timeframe than an active trading timeframe. It intends to ride the momentum of a stock that's outperforming the market, staying in until it loses its momentum.

The rules are simple:

Long Only
Go Long when a candle closes above the Upper Keltner Channel
Close positions that close below the Lower Keltner Channel.
The idea is to maintain a small portfolio of outperforming stocks to beat a Buy & Hold strategy

Keltner variant of Nick Radge's Unholy Grails Bollinger Strategy

Default settings are:
100 SMA
Upper Multiplier: 3
Lower Multiplier: 1

Uses a Date & Time Range function by allanster
Open-source script

